{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a tab-based product collection section similar to a category switcher. At the top, show a heading and a row of clickable category tabs (like "Outdoor", "Living Room", "Dining Room", etc.) with the active tab highlighted in a gold/orange color and inactive tabs in a muted blue-gray. Below the tabs, display a product grid filtered by the selected tab/collection. Layout: 4 products per row on desktop, 2 products per row on mobile. Each product card should show: product image with a badge label (e.g. "Summer Sales") in the top-left corner, product title, a coupon/discount badge or pill (e.g. "Extra 12% OFF" or a promo code tag) between the title and the price, then the sale price and original crossed-out price in red. Tabs should switch the displayed products dynamically without page reload. Each tab should be linked to a different collection. All content (heading, tab labels, collections) should be customizable in the theme editor., 产品标题不超过两行, 标签单行滑动排列，并且顶部固定，方便切换。分类对应的coupon可以不同设置，sale标签内容也可以根据分类的不同设置。通过标签切换分类时自动返回该分类第一个产品处, 标签导航栏要顶部固定
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
